{"type":"message","id":"02c46e27","parentId":"b05d8424","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:16:18.891Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:18","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# A-224.00 Wall Section Analysis - ED Ambulance Bay Addition (H+H Bellevue)\n\n## Key Elevations & Dimensions\n\n**Floor Levels:**\n- **Ground Floor (Actual 1st Floor):** 12'-1 1/2\" (consistent across all sections)\n- **Mezzanine:** 29'-1 1/2\" (one section shows 25'-1 1/2\")\n- **Canopy T.O.S.:** 26'-7 1/2\" (appears at multiple locations)\n\n## Wall Sections Identified (Scale: 1\" = 1'-0\")\n\n| Detail | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **A8** | Interior Wall Section @ Storefront |\n| **A6** | Interior Wall Section @ Exist Wall Infill |\n| **A5** | Exterior Wall Section @ Brick/CMU Wall |\n| **A3** | Interior Wall Section @ Sliding Glass Door |\n| **A1** | Exterior Wall Section @ Insulation of Exist Wall |\n\n## Foundation Details\n- **Concrete foundation wall** - referenced to structural drawings\n- **New slab on grade** - see structural drawings\n- Foundation walls visible below ground floor level\n\n## Wall Assembly Callouts\n- **Non-insulated wall** noted with reference to \"see detail, stamped, and sealed by model engineer\"\n- **Existing brick wall** to remain at multiple locations\n- **Existing wall to remain** noted in several sections\n- **Existing roof deck** at top of sections\n- **Exist canopy steel** referenced\n\n## Canopy Connection\n- Canopy T.O.S. elevation: **26'-7 1/2\"** (repeated at 3+ locations)\n- Connects to existing canopy steel structure\n- Located between ground floor and mezzanine levels\n\n## Specific Dimensions\n- Ground floor to mezzanine span: ~17'-0\" (29'-1½\" minus 12'-1½\")\n- Detail references: 1.B (upper detail), 1.A (lower detail), plus numbered cross-references (BB5.1, BB5.2, BB5.4, etc.)\n- Section callout bub"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-be