{"type":"message","id":"5e3c39a4","parentId":"02c46e27","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:16:34.357Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:19","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Analysis of Sheet A-400 (Interior Elevations)\n\n**Important Note:** This is actually sheet **A-400.00 - Interior Elevations**, not A-501 (Roof/RCP). This sheet contains interior elevation views, not a roof plan. Therefore, specific roof dimensions, drainage locations, and ceiling plan information are **not available** on this sheet.\n\n## What This Sheet Contains\n\n### Interior Elevation Views (1/4\" = 1'-0\" scale):\n- **B8, B7** – NYPD Security Pick Up\n- **B5** – Cart Wash\n- **B4** – Cart Wash\n- **B3** – Vestibule\n- **C6** – Cart Wash - Exterior\n- **C5** – Vestibule\n- **A8, A6** – Security Check-In\n- **10, 11, 12** – Security Check-In\n\n### Dimension Callouts Visible:\n- **Ceiling heights**: Appears to show approximately **7'-0\"**, **7'-8\"**, **9'-0\"** heights in various views\n- **2'-10\"** and **1'-2\"** dimensions noted in some details\n- **3'-6\"** dimension visible in some elevations\n- Television noted as **\"WALL MOUNTED\"** in B8\n\n### Structural Grid Lines Referenced:\n- Grid lines **1 through 8** (horizontal axis at top)\n- Grid lines **A through F** (vertical axis)\n\n### Elevation Keynotes (ED Addition):\n- **A2** through **A9** – Various ballistic-resistant storefront, aluminum, and glazing systems\n- References to bullet-proofing (UL/NIJ rated) materials\n\n## Project Info\n- **Project:** H+H Bellevue – ED Ambulance Bay Addition\n- **Address:** 462 1st Avenue, New York, NY 10016\n- **Project No.:** 6629\n- **Date:** 09/25/25\n\n**To obtain roof dimensions, canopy footprints, and drainage locations, sheet A-501 would need to be provided.**"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_020.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770052594351}}
{"type":"message","id":"c66e83db","parentId":"5e3c39a4","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:16:51.450Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:20","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Analysis of Drawing A-102.00 (Equipment Plan)\n\n**Note:** This is actually sheet **A-102.00 - Equipment Plan**, not A-200 Exterior Components. It's for the **H+H Bellevue ED Ambulance Bay Addition** at 462 1st Avenue, New York, NY 10016, by Array Architects. Scale: 1/4\" = 1'-0\".\n\n## Extracted Dimensions\n\n### 1. Building Footprint\nThe plan shows grid lines 1-8 (horizontal) and A-F (vertical). Specific overall dimensions are not clearly legible in this resolution, but grid bays are labeled:\n- **1.B, 2.B, 2.B1** along the upper portion\n- **5.B, 6.B** grid references visible\n\n### 2. Exterior Wall Lengths\nExact wall dimensions are not clearly readable at this resolution. The building has an **L-shaped footprint** with the ambulance court on the west/upper side.\n\n### 3. Canopy\n- **\"EXISTING EMERGENCY CANOPY ABOVE\"** is noted in the ambulance court area\n- **\"EXISTING OBSERVATION DECK ABOVE\"** noted at upper portion\n- No specific canopy dimensions are legible\n\n### 4. Doors and Openings\n- **5'-4\" Clearance to Wheelchair** noted at one entrance\n- **Entrance Vestibule** identified\n- **Cart Alcove** identified\n- **Auto Operator (DORMA ED 35)** specified at entry\n\n### 5. Key Identified Spaces/Elements\n- **Ambulance Court** (exterior)\n- **Security** station\n- **NYPD Security Room**\n- **Cart Wash** area\n- **Entrance Vestibule**\n- **Weapon Detection** zone\n- **New Ramp with Asphalt** at ambulance court\n- **Bike Rack** location\n- **360 Camera** locations marked\n\n### Limitations\nThis equipment plan prioritizes equipment placement over dimensional data. **Exterior envelope dimensions would be on sheets A-200 series (elevations) or A-100 series (floor plans with dimensions).** Most numeric building dimensions are"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_010.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770052611444}}
