{"type":"message","id":"33d5c6b8","parentId":"857bf203","timestamp":"2026-02-02T17:20:45.725Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"image:42","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Sheet Analysis: A-302.00 — EXTERIOR DETAILS\n\n## 1. Sheet Title and Number\n- **Title:** EXTERIOR DETAILS\n- **Sheet Number:** A-302.00\n- **Project:** H+H Bellevue — **ED AMBULANCE BAY ADDITION**\n- **Project No.:** 6629\n- **Date:** 09/25/25\n- **Issue:** ISSUED SOLUTION FOR BID\n\n## 2. Details Shown (Not a Finish Floor Plan)\n\nThis is a **details sheet**, not a floor plan. It contains exterior wall section details:\n\n- **D2** — Exterior Wall Base Detail (3\" = 1'-0\")\n- **D5** — Wall Head @ Exist Canopy (3\" = 1'-0\")\n- **A5** — Type 1 Slab on Grade (3\" = 1'-0\")\n- **A2** — Top of Wall Detail @ Exist Stair Brick Wing Wall (3\" = 1'-0\")\n- **A8** — Signage Assembly Detail (6\" = 1'-0\")\n\n## 3. Key Dimensions & Numeric Data\n\n- **Canopy T.O.S.:** 39' - 1 1/2\"\n- **Canopy T.O.S.:** 38' - 1 1/2\" (at another location)\n- **Mezzanine:** 26' - 1 1/2\"\n- **Dowels:** 36\" OC\n- **Insulation:** 2\" continuous polyiso, min R-6.5\n- **Batt insulation:** 3.5\" min R-13\n- **Metal studs:** 3 5/8\"\n- **GYP:** 5/8\"\n- **CMU:** 8\"\n- **Compressible filler** at slab on grade Type 1\n- **2'-0\"** from slab exterior edge\n- **1.5\" polyiso, R-7.5 min**\n- **Signage bracket:** 2\"x2\" L bracket mounting plates\n\n## 4. Area Calculations\n- **None shown** on this sheet."}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_017.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770052845719}}
